    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d388">

                <pb facs="0386" n="270" xml:id="pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/351a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister Hartman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-14T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 14, 1914, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Press reports revolutionary troops occupy Tulcan. Report briefly by telegraph
                    revolutionary situation and strength of Plaza’s Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
